  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Wandījo 21",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbyalwa kwa ng'wa Isaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūngeniha ū Saala gīt'umo walī wang'wisagīgīja; na ng'hana ū SEEBA ūng'wītīla ū Saala ūmo walī wisagīgīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saala ūbūūcha nda, ūmyalīla ū Abulahamu ng'wana ngosha mu būnamhala bokwe, ng'wikanza īlo Mulungu walī wang'wīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Abulahamu ūng'wilīka ī lina lya Isaka ū ng'wana ūyo Saala akamyalīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūnsaala ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Isaka aho washisha shikū inaane, gīt'umo Mulungu walī wanagīīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu walī na myaka igana (100) aho alībyalwa ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saala ūhaya, “Ū Mulungu wanenhelile seko, na būlī ng'wene ūyo alagwigwe ū mhayo gwenūyū akūseka hamò nane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ongeja hangī kūhaya, “Nani ūyo walī ashikile kūng'wīla Abulahamu gīkī, ‘Nū Saala adūgije konhya baana?’ Alīyo ī haha angū ūūyū namyalīla ng'wana ngosha mu būnamhala bokwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haagali na Ishimaeli kwīnjiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nīgīnī ūkūla kūshisha ūgijiwa; ū mu lūshikū lwa kūgijiwa, ū Abulahamu akabeeja shigukulu shitaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Saala ūbona gīkī ū ng'witūnja ūyo Haagali muna Misili walī wamyalīla ū Abulahamu, alī n'ibengwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū Abulahamu gīkī, “Ng'wīnjage a henaha ū nsese ng'wenūyū nū ng'wtūnja wakwe; nguno ū ng'witūnja wa nsese ng'wenūyū atīko kūbiza na wingīji hamò nū ng'witūnja wane ū Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo gūkankoya no ū Abulahamu, kūlwa nguno ya ng'wana wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūtakoyage no kūlwa nguno ya ng'witūnja wako nū nina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nina:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū ū nsese wako nkīma.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ū Saala ng'wigwage mu yose īyo alīkūwīla; nguno ū būbyīle wako būkūbalwa kūbītīla mulī Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū būbyīle wa ng'witūnja wa nkīma ū nsese, nakūwīta kūbiza ihanga, guno nang'hwe ng'witūnja wako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kū ntondo yaho ū Abulahamu wipuuna dilū, ūsola shilīwa na minzī ng'wibūūkījo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'wibūūkījo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū mhīnda; babeejaga mhīnda ja ndīlī kūlwa kūtūūlīla minzī, mabeele nūūlū walwa (divai).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūng'winha ū Haagali ūshibūūcha; hūna ūnshindīkīla. Ū Haagali ūbūūka ajile alī hamò nū nyanda; ūja akūyūngaga hose hose ng'witogolo lya Beeli-sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gūshila ū ng'wibūūkījo al'ū ng'witogolo ng'wenūmo; ūntūūla ū nyanda mu mbeho y'isaka līmò lyaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū wei wīnga ho ūkigasha kakūle, gītī bū kūle bo kūluuta kawe, wandya kūlīla ng'hūngū; kūnū akwiwīlaga wei ng'wenekīlī gīkī, “Natūdūla ū kūng'wiloleela ū nyanda alīshilīlīkīīla kūcha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūng'wigwa ū nyanda alīlīla, hūna Malaika wa ng'wa Mulungu ūng'witana ū Haagali kūfuma ng'wigūlū, ūng'wīla gīkī, “Haagali ūlīkoyiwa kī? Ūtoogohage; ū Mulungu wang'wigwaga ū nyanda ūmo alīlīlīla aho alambalalile henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaga ūkandime ū nkono gwakwe ū nyanda, ūngūngūmūle; nguno nakūng'wīta kūbiza ihanga itaale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Mulungu ūgakundūlīla a miso gakwe, ūbona itaba lya minzī; ūja ho ūkalyokaja minzī ī libūūkījo lyakwe, wiza ūng'winha ū nyanda ūng'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu walī hamò nū nyanda ng'wenūyo, kūshisha ūkūla. Akabiza ng'wikaji wa ng'witogolo, ū nīmo gwakwe gwalī būlasi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyikala ng'witogolo lya Palani, ū nina ūja Misili ūkankoobela nkīma ūtoola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abulahamu na Abimeleki kwiyilahīlīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo, ū Abimeleki hamò na Pikoli, ūyo walī ntaale wa bashilikale bakwe, būng'wīla ū Abulahamu gīkī, “Ū bebe ū Mulungu alī hamò nang'ho mu yose īyo ūkwītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nilahīlīlage kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu, gīkī ūtalizūniiboneela mu mhayo gose gose, ū nene ng'wenīkīlī na a baana bane, nū būbyīle wane ūbo būkwiza ha numa yane. Ūmo naakwītīlile yawiza ū bebe, nū nene nīītīlage gīko, pyī nī sī yane, ūmo ūkwikalaga gītī nobeji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Abulahamu ūhaya, “Nalīkūlahīlīla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Abulahamu wibūūla ū kūlī Abimeleki kūlwa lwinzī lwakwe ūlo batūmami ba ng'wa Abimeleki baalī balwidaatya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Abimeleki ūhaya, “Ū nene natandeebile ūyo wagwīta ū mhayo gwenūyū, walī ūtaalī kūniwīla; lelo hū naagwigwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Abulahamu wenha ng'holo na ng'ombe wiza ūng'winha ū Abimeleki; ī likanza lyenīlo a banhū benabo biyilahīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūkomanya ndogoosa mpungatī ja ng'holo kūfuma ū ng'widaale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abimeleki ūmūja gīkī, “Ī ndogoosa ja ng'holo ī mpungatī jenīji wajikomanya, ja mbika kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūnshokeja, “Ī ng'holo mpungatī jenīji jafumaga mu nkono gwane, janukūlage kūlwa būkanhīji gīkī hū nene naalūsīmba ū lwinzī lwenūlū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī lipandī lyenīlo litanwa Beeli-sheba, kūlwa nguno a banhū benabo bakiyilahīlīla a henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bamala ū kūlagana ū mu shilahīlo shenīsho, ū Abimeleki nū Pikoli, ū ntaale wa bashilikale, būshoka kū sī ya Bafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūhamba nshishi ī Beeli-sheba; a henaho ūlīkumīlīja ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa welelo na welelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu akashinga shikū ningī ū mu sī ya Bafilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
